+# Mini Template
+
+A dependency-free TypeScript template renderer for Bun.
+
+## Use as a library
+
+```ts
+import { render } from "./src/engine.ts";
+
+render("Hello, {{user.name}}!", { user: { name: "Ada" } });
+```
+
+Double braces HTML-escape scalar values; triple braces output them unchanged. It supports `if`/`else`, array-only `each` loops, comments, `this`, `@index`, root-path fallback within loops, nested blocks, and helpful structural errors.
+
+## CLI
+
+```sh
+bun run src/cli.ts template.txt data.json
+```
+
+The CLI writes only rendered content to stdout. Invalid arguments, files, JSON, or templates are reported on stderr with a non-zero exit code.
+
+## Test
+
+```sh
+bun test
+```
